    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong> is a chaotic co-op drawing game. The gameplay consists of 1 guesser while the rest of the players are artists. At the beginning of each round, a prompt is chosen and the group is tasked with collaborating their drawing skills for a comprehensive image. After the drawing rounds are completed, the guesser has a chance to guess the prompt. When the round completes, the next round will start and a new guesser will be assigned.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw, Draw, Pass!</strong> is a chaotic co-op drawing game. The gameplay consists of 1 guesser while the rest of the players are artists. At the beginning of each round, a prompt is chosen and the group is tasked with collaborating their drawing skills for a comprehensive image. After the drawing rounds are completed, the guesser has a chance to guess the prompt. When the round completes, the next round will start and a new guesser will be assigned.</p>",
    "short_description": "Create a room or join a party, this game gets more chaotic with more people! Collaborate together on one canvas as artists and the guesser has to figure out the drawing. Will your friends make a masterpiece or a mess?",
